@* ActionBannerStatesGallery.razor — TEMPORARY states gallery for comparing
   AppActionBanner against the Figma "btn_box" component's 3 stacked states.
   Not part of Screen A/B; safe to delete once the comparison is done. Uses
   only the shared AppActionBanner + shared tokens/CSS — no page-specific
   component styling added, per CLAUDE.md §3 (the <style> block below is
   layout-only, arranging the gallery cells themselves, same convention as
   demo/ButtonStatesGallery.razor).

   CORRECTED — this component's 3rd state is onClick/pressed, not Disabled
   (see AppActionBanner.razor's own header comment): there is no Disabled
   parameter/cell any more. All 3 cells use AppActionBanner's real CSS (no
   fake swatches) — move your mouse over the Hover cell for its real :hover
   color; "onClick" is a genuine, transient :active state (same as
   AppButton's own), which only paints while the mouse/key is actually held
   down, so click and hold on that cell to see the real
   --btn-pri-color-bg-active color live. *@
@page "/demo/action-banner-states"

<PageTitle>AppActionBanner — states gallery</PageTitle>

<h1>AppActionBanner — states gallery (Figma "btn_box")</h1>
<p>
    3 states from the Figma component: <strong>Default</strong>,
    <strong>Hover</strong> (move your mouse over it), and
    <strong>onClick</strong> (press and hold the mouse/key to see the real
    <code>:active</code> color — it won't show in a static screenshot).
    Each renders through AppActionBanner's real CSS/code path — the badge
    and pill button share one synchronized color per state.
</p>

<div class="action-banner-states-grid">
    <div class="action-banner-states-cell">
        <h2>Default</h2>
        <AppActionBanner Title="مزامنة يدوية لجميع المراكز"
                          Description="وصف المزامنة اليدوية"
                          ButtonLabel="بدء المزامنة اليدوية" />
    </div>

    <div class="action-banner-states-cell">
        <h2>Hover (move mouse over it)</h2>
        <AppActionBanner Title="مزامنة يدوية لجميع المراكز"
                          Description="وصف المزامنة اليدوية"
                          ButtonLabel="بدء المزامنة اليدوية" />
    </div>

    <div class="action-banner-states-cell">
        <h2>onClick (press &amp; hold)</h2>
        <AppActionBanner Title="مزامنة يدوية لجميع المراكز"
                          Description="وصف المزامنة اليدوية"
                          ButtonLabel="بدء المزامنة اليدوية" />
    </div>
</div>

<style>
    /* Page-local layout only (stacked arrangement of the gallery itself) —
       not a reusable visual pattern, so it's fine here rather than
       components.css per CLAUDE.md §3.1's rule of thumb. Nothing here sets
       a color/size that AppActionBanner itself needs. */
    .action-banner-states-grid {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 24px;
        max-width: 700px;
    }

    .action-banner-states-cell h2 {
        font-size: 14px;
        margin: 0 0 8px;
    }
</style>
